      "divergence": {
        "note": "2026-09-07 SPLIT DONE: the former Container Type axis (default|dialog|panel|overlay-panel| accordion) was split into SEPARATE components in Figma AND code (ratified D2/D12). Figma \"Container\" is now a plain COMPONENT (Type=default only), and dialog/panel/overlay-panel/ accordion are standalone Figma components + code components on native elements: dialog→sherpa-dialog (<dialog> modal), overlay-panel→sherpa-overlay-panel (<dialog> non-modal), accordion→sherpa-accordion (<details>), panel→sherpa-panel (<section>). sherpa-container is now just the base card surface (header/body/footer slots + states)."
